WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 005. DON’T AUTOMATE THE SERVICE.. Separate the steps first.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
ONE SERVICE. THREE FUTURES.. AUTOMATE · KEEP HUMAN · REMOVE

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
REMOVE. LOW-VALUE REPETITION FIRST.. Do not automate waste just because it repeats.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
KEEP HUMAN. PROTECT JUDGMENT.. High consequence, ambiguity and exception-heavy work can remain human-led.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
AUTOMATE. PROTOTYPE STABLE RULES.. Automation is a candidate disposition—not a deployment approval.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. SOFTWARE / HUMAN / GONE. A better workflow can contain all three.

